 <h3><u>Kushta-e-shamsheer alamdaar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Aye alamdaar... Saqqa e sakina<br> Abbas alamdaar, alamdaar..(2)<br> Peshe nigaahe shahe karbala<br> ghalti daye khaako khoo'n<br> shud parchame bawafa<br> nauhakuna sayyede abraar<br> Ah uftaad e sare karbobala ya zainab..(2)<br> kushta e shamsheer alamdaar<br> kushta e shamsheer alamdaar, alamdaar..(2)<br> Allah, Allah...<br> kushta e shamsheer alamdaar, alamdaar..(2)<br> Alamdaar, Alamdaar</p> 
  <p>1. Haaye...<br> Ae bahan jispe naaza the hum<br> hogaye hai wo baazu qalam<br> pyaaso pe fida hogaya, saqqa e sakina<br> pardes mein hum dono ka, dushwaar hai jeena<br> arey,<br> bhai hume chhod gaya ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>2. Haaye,<br> Aaayi maqtal se jab ye sada<br> aaiye ibne shere khuda<br> jis samt se awaaz mujhe aai thi behna<br> mai thokre khaata hua us simt hi nikla<br> arey,<br> raah mein ek bazu mila, ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>3. Haaye....<br> Phir usi samt mai chal diya<br> aai thi jis taraf se sadaa<br> jab dusra bazu mila, us shere jari ka<br> dil dard se lachaar hua, tere akhi ka<br> arey,<br> hoto pe aayi ye buka, ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>4. Haaye...<br> Aye bahan thaam lo dil zara<br> phir wo lamha qareeb aagaya<br> be dast alamdaar ko, jab khaak pe dekha<br> us sher ki peshani pe, ek gurz laga tha<br> arey,<br> dil pe wahi gurz laga, ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>5. Haaye...<br> Phir wo karne laga yu kalaam<br> ibne zehra ho tumpar salaam<br> mai roke ye bola ke, zara aankhein to kholo<br> aye bhai agar koi, wasiyat hai to kehdo<br> arey,<br> sunke jari rone laga, ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>6. Haaye...<br> Roke ghaazi ye kehne laga<br> arz itni hai shahe huda<br> mai mashk pe qurbaan hua, ye to batana<br> par laash meri khaime mein, lekar nahi jaana<br> arey,<br> maine bhi aisa hi kiya, ya zainab<br> Ah uftaad....</p> 
  <p>7. Haaye...<br> Sunke zainab ne nauha kiya<br> ab chinegi yaqeenan rida<br> aye mazharo irfan wo, qayamat ka tha manzar<br> ghaazi ki bahan aagayi, khaimo mein tadapkar<br> arey<br> khaimo mein kohraam utha...<br> Haye alamdaar, haye alamdaar, haye alamdaar</p> 
